  unitName: Duel-GX
  unitId: 60253
  unitNumber: 356
  description: A strange mechanical figure from another world. It is not known when
    or even where it was made. It did, however, seem to have a purpose. Duel-GX was
    created to defeat that which destroyed the world in which it was created. To
    accomplish this it began looking for others to help as it started to strengthen
    itself as well. The first person it identified as its partner was a self-centered
    girl who held an axe in each hand. As the girl came to know him as "Crab," Duel-GX's
    circuits began activating.
  summonDesc: NEW MASTER DETECTED.<br>REGISTRATION COMPLETE.<br>PLEASE INPUT COMMANDS.
